    <detaileddescription>
<para>ThemisDB Erasure Coding Backend for Blob Storage</para>
<para>Implements space-efficient redundancy using Reed-Solomon erasure codes. Supports RS(10,4), RS(6,3), RS(4,2) and arbitrary (k,m) configurations.</para>
<para>Benefits over mirroring:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>RS(10,4): 40% overhead vs 200% for 2× mirroring</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>RS(6,3): 50% overhead, tolerates 3 simultaneous node failures</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>RS(4,2): 50% overhead, fast encode/decode for smaller blobs</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
